  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n (81frac{³⁾/⁽⁴⁾ times ((1)/(27))⁻⁽²⁾/⁽³⁾}{(sqrt{32}+sqrt{8})²-(sqrt{32}-sqrt{8})²} \n\n**Formula Used:**\n\n am = (aⁿ)⁽m⁾/⁽ⁿ⁾ \n\n (a+b)²-(a-b)²=4ab \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 81⁽³⁾/⁽⁴⁾ = (3⁴)⁽³⁾/⁽⁴⁾ = 3³ = 27\n\n⇒ ((1)/(27))⁻⁽²⁾/⁽³⁾ = 27⁽²⁾/⁽³⁾\n\n⇒ = (3³)⁽²⁾/⁽³⁾ = 3² = 9\n\n⇒ 27 times 9 = 243\n\n⇒ (sqrt{32}+sqrt{8})²-(sqrt{32}-sqrt{8})² = 4sqrt{32}sqrt{8}\n\n⇒ = 4sqrt{256}\n\n⇒ = 4 times 16\n\n⇒ = 64\n\n⇒ = (243)/(64)\n\n**∴ The correct answer is (243)/(64) .**",
